# Gold Contract Radar — MCX Commodity Derivatives Intelligence
# Environment Configuration Example
#
# NOTE: Gold Contract Radar runs completely self-contained on validated historical
# MCX Bhavcopy datasets included in data/processed/.
# No external API keys, database credentials, or secret tokens are required to launch
# the dashboard or run the automated test suite.
#
# Optional overrides (defaults will be used if unset):
# STREAMLIT_SERVER_PORT=8501
# STREAMLIT_SERVER_HEADLESS=true
